5,1,1,talk,Minako,,The current system is failing. We need to know the actual time cost before committing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. I suspect the workload is skewed based on who is actually here.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I just want to know why the bathroom smells bad sometimes and not others.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I am worried about the small expenses. Who is paying for the sponges lately?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ensure this arrangement keeps us speaking to each other kindly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, do you have data on who is home versus who is cleaning?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I have a feeling, but no proof. Let's look at the calendar.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I can check the bathroom grout. It looks bad after a while.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will check the receipts in the tin. It feels unfair to guess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I will read the note from the previous tenants. History repeats itself.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I need to time a full clean. I want to know the hours.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will watch the kitchen for a fortnight. Who is really using it?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I will check what everyone thinks is ""done"". It changes too much.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the management office rates. Just in case we need help.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at the house chat logs. I want to see how we argue.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let's gather these facts. Then we can decide.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic first. Emotions later.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Okay! I am ready to look into things.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Thank you all. I hope this brings some peace.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,A good start. Let us see what the truth reveals.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
