35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The timing is brutal. Forty-seven minutes for the kitchen alone. And two people are gone half the month.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The kitchen data confirms my suspicion. Two people cook, three make coffee. The work is not shared.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The grout gets dirty in eleven days. And ""done"" means different things to everyone. That explains the mess.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The receipts show we spend 2,300 yen monthly, often buying duplicates. The office cleaner is 4,200 an hour.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The previous tenants stopped speaking by year two. Our last two rows started with reminders. We are on that path.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if two people are away, the remaining three carry the load. That is unsustainable.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, exactly. The ""fair"" share is a myth if presence varies. We need a system that accounts for absence.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"If we don't agree on what ""clean"" is, we will always be guessing. I hate guessing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"The cost of supplies is low, but the cost of a professional is high. We need to be careful.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,The note from the previous tenants is a warning. Permanent assignments led to silence. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A fixed rota might work if it rotates fairly, but what about the absences?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A paid service removes the time burden, but the invoice must be split fairly.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I like the idea of knowing exactly what to do. No more guessing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the monthly cost of a service. 4,200 yen an hour adds up quickly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"If we hire help, we remove the friction. But we must agree on the terms first.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am leaning towards a service. It removes the time from my schedule.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree, provided the billing is transparent. The management office handles the contract.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"As long as the bathroom is clean, I am happy. I don't care who does it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am concerned about the cost, but I am open to it if we split it fairly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us consider the options. We want to keep our peace.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
